---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy | Tours Peruvian Travel" description="Our Privacy Policy describes how we collect, use, and protect your personal information.">
  <div class="pt-24 pb-16 bg-slate-50 min-h-screen">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6">
      <div class="bg-white rounded-3xl shadow-xl p-8 md:p-12 border border-slate-100">
        <div class="mb-6 pb-6 border-b border-slate-100">
          <h1 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-black text-slate-800 mb-2">Privacy Policy</h1>
          <p class="text-slate-500 text-sm">Last updated: June 2026</p>
        </div>

        <div class="prose prose-slate prose-sm max-w-none prose-headings:font-bold prose-headings:text-slate-800 prose-p:text-slate-600 prose-p:leading-relaxed prose-li:text-slate-600">
          <p>At <strong>Tours Peruvian service</strong>, we value your privacy and are committed to protecting your personal data. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, and share information when you use our services and website.</p>
          
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold mt-6 mb-3 text-slate-800">1. Information We Collect</h2>
          <p>We collect personal information that you voluntarily provide to us when booking a package, subscribing to our newsletter, or contacting us. This may include:</p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-5">
            <li>First and last names.</li>
            <li>Contact information (email address, phone number).</li>
            <li>Identity document or passport (necessary for reservations and insurance).</li>
            <li>Payment and billing information.</li>
          </ul>
          
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold mt-6 mb-3 text-slate-800">2. Use of Information</h2>
          <p>We use your personal information to:</p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-5">
            <li>Process and manage your tour, flight, and hotel reservations.</li>
            <li>Communicate with you regarding confirmations, itinerary changes, or emergencies.</li>
            <li>Improve our services and the experience on our website.</li>
            <li>Send promotions or special offers, provided you have given prior consent.</li>
          </ul>

          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold mt-6 mb-3 text-slate-800">3. Data Protection</h2>
          <p>We implement technical and organizational security measures to protect your personal data against unauthorized access, alteration, disclosure, or destruction. We strictly comply with Law No. 29733, Personal Data Protection Law of Peru.</p>

          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold mt-6 mb-3 text-slate-800">4. Information Sharing</h2>
          <p>We only share your information with trusted service providers (such as airlines, hotels, and local tour operators) to the extent strictly necessary to fulfill the provision of contracted services.</p>

          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold mt-6 mb-3 text-slate-800">5. Your Rights</h2>
          <p>You have the right to Access, Rectify, Cancel, and Oppose the use of your personal data. To exercise these rights, you can send us an email at <strong>legales@toursperuvianservice.com.pe</strong> attaching a copy of your identity document.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
